"shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper>`, "
"precum :doc:`GLS </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/gls>`, :doc:`MPL </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/mpl>` "
"sau :doc:`Foxpost </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/foxpost>`. Un conector de expediere "
"se leagă de acești curieri, automatizând :doc:`etichetele de urmărire </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/labels>` și procesele de expediere."

