#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/tracking.rst:60
msgid ":guilabel:`Product Identifier`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Identificator produs`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/tracking.rst:61
msgid ""
"The identifier of the products in the events **and** in the :doc:`product "
"feeds <product_feeds>`. See :ref:`ecommerce/tracking/identifier`."
msgstr ""
"Identificatorul produselor din evenimente **și** din :doc:`feedurile de "
"produse <product_feeds>`. Consultați :ref:`ecommerce/tracking/identifier`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/tracking.rst:63
msgid ":guilabel:`Conversion Value`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Valoarea conversiei`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/tracking.rst:64
