#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/tracking.rst:66
msgid ":guilabel:`Report Purchases`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Raportare achiziții`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/tracking.rst:67
msgid "When the purchase is reported. See :ref:`ecommerce/tracking/purchase`."
msgstr ""
"Când este raportată achiziția. Consultați "
