#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/tracking.rst:68
msgid ":guilabel:`Exclude Shipping Lines`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Excludere linii de livrare`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/tracking.rst:69
msgid ""
"Enabled by default. The delivery lines are not sent as purchased items. The "
"shipping amount is sent separately."
msgstr ""
"Activat implicit. Liniile de livrare nu sunt trimise ca articole cumpărate. "
"Suma de livrare este trimisă separat."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/tracking.rst:71
msgid ":guilabel:`Exclude Discount Lines`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Excludere linii de reducere`"

