msgstr ""
"Căutați grupul :guilabel:`Tipuri de utilizatori / Portal`, selectați-l, apoi "
"faceți clic pe :guilabel:`Selectează`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/header_footer.rst:245
msgid "Save."
msgstr "Salvează."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/header_footer.rst:248
msgid ""
"To hide the `Shop` menu item, :doc:`restrict ecommerce access to logged-in "
